{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13517","headline":"濮中言怀 · 沈千运","name":"濮中言怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣朝优贤良，草泽无遗匿。\n人生各有命，在余胡不淑。\n一生但区区，五十无寸禄。\n衰退当弃捐，贫贱招毁讟。\n栖栖去人世，屯踬日穷迫。\n不如守田园，岁晏望丰熟。\n壮年失宜尽，老大无筋力。\n始觉前计非，将贻後生福。\n童儿新学稼，少女未能织。\n顾此烦知己，终日求衣食。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈千运","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13517.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13517","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}